    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area : 103 sqm\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this recently refurbished 3 bedroomed semi-detached home which comes to the market ready for immediate occupation. 17 Luttrell Park Drive presents in turn-key condition and offers a very special opportunity for a discerning purchaser to secure a home that offers wonderful balance in terms of light and room proportions.\n\nThe property has been decorated to an exacting standard and presents ample and well considered accommodation. A tasteful approach was adopted whilst decorating this home, and accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hall with a guest wc, bright and well proportioned living room, dining room with direct access to the rear garden, kitchen/breakfast room. Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms (main en-suite) and a family bathroom completes the accommodation. Outside there is off street parking to the front and a paved driveway which leads to a side passage with a gated side entrance to the walled rear garden.\n\nLuttrell Park Drive is excellently located close to all local amenities such as the villages of Castleknock and Blanchardstown, The Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and The Phoenix Park. This area is well serviced by buses to the City Centre and the property also benefits from close proximity to the Coolmine Train Station, it being a 5 minute walk. Access to the M3 & M50 is within easy reach. The City Centre and Dublin Airport is approximately a twenty minute drive away. Luttrell Park falls into the catchment area of Castleknock Community College and many other reputable schools are within close proximity.\n\nViewing is imperative to fully appreciate this all-encompassing family home which wont disappoint!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.87m (6'2\") x 5.11m (16'9\")\nwith tiled floor, alarm panel, understair storage\n\nGuest W.C. - 0.85m (2'9\") x 1.51m (4'11\")\nwith w.c & w.h.b., fully tiled\n\nLounge - 3.55m (11'8\") x 5.4m (17'9\")\nwith solid wood floor, feature fireplace with limestone surround and stove\n\nKitchen - 2.63m (8'8\") x 5.88m (19'3\")\nwith a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback, fridge freezer, dishwasher, oven, hob & extractor fan, access onto the rear garden\n\nDiningroom - 2.88m (9'5\") x 3.94m (12'11\")\nwith tiled floor, double doors leading onto the rear garden\n\nLanding - 2.33m (7'8\") x 3.27m (10'9\")\nwith carpet floor, access to attic, hot press\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.7m (8'10\") x 5.03m (16'6\")\nto the front of house with laminate wood floor & built in sliding wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 3.08m (10'1\") x 1.26m (4'2\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b. with vanity unit & shower cubicle with pumped shower, fully tiled, heated towel rail\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.08m (10'1\") x 3.54m (11'7\")\nto the rear of house with wood floor & built in sliding wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.08m (6'10\") x 2.86m (9'5\")\nto the front of house with wood floor & built in sliding wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.79m (5'10\") x 2.46m (8'1\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., & bath with shower attachment, heated towel rail, fully tiled\n\n"
      },
      {
